  {
   "id": "army-timer",
   "comment": "Army battle countdown (Level_1/Time/Text, 116x80.5 UpperCenter, Source Han Serif 45). Battles without a time limit show System/Infinity = 'Infinite' for the whole fight (TopTime.SetText(-1)): 175px at 45, broken to 'Infin' / 'ite' and truncated in the prefab box. Best fit 20-45 in a 66px-tall box: one 45px line is 64.7px (font asset line height 22.992 per 16px = 1.437em), so the countdown digits keep 45px and move under 1px; two lines would only fit at 22px or less, while 'Infinite' fits one line at 29-30px (116px at 30), so the word is never split. MiddleCenter puts the ink of 'Infinite' at panel y29 and below, clear of the 'Time' caption (UpperRight 20px, ink ends at y21.5, x103..155). A 60px box would shrink the digits to 41px.",
   "path": "/[UI]/MainUI/Level_1/Time/Text",
   "onTextChange": true,
   "rect": {
    "height": 66
   },
   "text": {
    "bestFit": true,
    "minSize": 20,
    "maxSize": 45,
    "alignment": "MiddleCenter",
    "hOverflow": "Wrap",
    "vOverflow": "Truncate"
   }
  },
